{"2092130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Notes From Province", "steam_appid": 2092130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [2116720], "detailed_description": "<h1>Need help?</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck on a puzzle? Stumped by a boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries! We have a welcoming, helpful Discord community available to answer questions, or just chat about the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/479b5f666d16bca182ceea0c0877644f.poster.avif?t=1763091517\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/479b5f666d16bca182ceea0c0877644f.webm?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a deep Open World that rewards exploration, solve clever puzzles with lateral thinking, and engage in unique, story-driven boss battles. Then take a break. Furnish your home, fish a little, and chill with your eccentric neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyme's searching for a fresh start in the city of Province. Will he find it among the eccentric residents and their whimsical adventures? Or will he get lost chasing his personal villain, a grand thief capable of stealing the blue from the sky, the voice of a singer, and even the very memory of what he stole, leaving you with nothing but an empty feeling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.poster.avif?t=1763091517\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.webm?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.mp4?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong> No dead ends, only new things to see and treasure to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character driven story</strong> Even the battles have a story to tell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 characters</strong> Each with distinct styles and roles, swap-able mid combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment based customization</strong> Abilities and passives come from equipment that can be freely swapped to redefine characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies worth reacting to</strong> Each encounter has a plan to crush you unless you spot the weakness and counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate and expand your house</strong> Earn bonus awards based on your furniture arrangement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPCs with lives</strong> Each villager has their own daily agenda, situational dialog, and a story to tell the more you get to know them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So much to do</strong> Crafting, cooking, fishing, dancing, finding a strange rat-loving man living in a hole under your neighbor's house</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/479b5f666d16bca182ceea0c0877644f.poster.avif?t=1763091517\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/479b5f666d16bca182ceea0c0877644f.webm?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a deep Open World that rewards exploration, solve clever puzzles with lateral thinking, and engage in unique, story-driven boss battles. Then take a break. Furnish your home, fish a little, and chill with your eccentric neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyme's searching for a fresh start in the city of Province. Will he find it among the eccentric residents and their whimsical adventures? Or will he get lost chasing his personal villain, a grand thief capable of stealing the blue from the sky, the voice of a singer, and even the very memory of what he stole, leaving you with nothing but an empty feeling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.poster.avif?t=1763091517\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.webm?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/extras/3da848e3747abec21c4365e60a398d77.mp4?t=1763091517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world</strong> No dead ends, only new things to see and treasure to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character driven story</strong> Even the battles have a story to tell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 characters</strong> Each with distinct styles and roles, swap-able mid combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment based customization</strong> Abilities and passives come from equipment that can be freely swapped to redefine characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies worth reacting to</strong> Each encounter has a plan to crush you unless you spot the weakness and counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate and expand your house</strong> Earn bonus awards based on your furniture arrangement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPCs with lives</strong> Each villager has their own daily agenda, situational dialog, and a story to tell the more you get to know them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So much to do</strong> Crafting, cooking, fishing, dancing, finding a strange rat-loving man living in a hole under your neighbor's house</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Dive into a deep Open World that rewards exploration. Solve clever puzzles with lateral thinking, and engage in unique, story-driven boss battles. Then take a break. Furnish your home, fish a little, and chill with your eccentric neighbors.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/header.jpg?t=1763091517", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763091517", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2092130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763091517", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft® Windows® XP / Vista / 7 (32-bit/64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Pentium® 4 2.0 GHz equivalent or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 